# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev` (this file is gitignored).
# No secrets are required yet: sessions are opaque random tokens hashed in D1,
# not signed JWTs, so there is no shared secret to manage. Add real secrets
# here as they come up (e.g. a future WhatsApp Cloud API token) and register
# them for staging/production with `wrangler secret put NAME --env staging`.
